Searching for conference table microphone rental in Malaga, Spain, usually means a meeting where several people speak from their seats: a boardroom, a panel behind a table, a client workshop in a hotel suite. This page explains the table microphones we actually own, which package includes one, how many a meeting needs, who controls the volume, and what we do when your meeting needs more than our own inventory covers.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) owns four Audix gooseneck table microphones and delivers, installs and tests them with a sound system across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. They are one part of our [audiovisual equipment rental service](/blog/audiovisual-equipment-rental-service/), and below we say plainly what we do not claim for them.

