## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear owns four Audix gooseneck table microphones, two ADX12 and two ADX212, each with a K&M base and an Audix D-Clip. They are wired into the mixing console of the sound system, so each speaker stays seated at the table while the level is managed from one place. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) include one each. More table microphones for a panel are a quoted add on, and more than four means suppliers.

